e tasks in parallel with 12-24 hour turnaround, UI design included, a dedicated designer of your choice, and a dedicated success manager.\",\n      \"price\": \"799\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cueballcreatives.com/graphic-design-plan\",\n      \"priceSpecification\": {\n        \"@type\": \"UnitPriceSpecification\",\n        \"price\": \"799\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n        \"unitText\": \"MONTH\"\n      },\n      \"shippingDetails\": {\n        \"@type\": \"OfferShippingDetails\",\n        \"shippingRate\": {\n          \"@type\": \"MonetaryAmount\",\n          \"value\": \"0\",\n          \"currency\": \"USD\"\n        },\n        \"shippingDestination\": {\n          \"@type\": \"DefinedRegion\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\n        },\n        \"deliveryTime\": {\n          \"@type\": \"ShippingDeliveryTime\",\n          \"handlingTime\": {\n            \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n            \"minValue\": 0,\n            \"maxValue\": 0,\n            \"unitCode\": \"DAY\"\n          },\n          \"transitTime\": {\n            \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n            \"minValue\": 0,\n            \"maxValue\": 0,\n            \"unitCode\": \"DAY\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"hasMerchantReturnPolicy\": {\n        \"@type\": \"MerchantReturnPolicy\",\n        \"applicableCountry\": \"US\",\n        \"returnPolicyCategory\": \"https://schema.org/MerchantReturnNotPermitted\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"name\": \"Scale Plan\",\n      \"description\": \"5 active tasks in parallel with a dedicated creative team of your choice, a success manager, and priority queue access across all clients.\",\n      \"price\": \"1199\",\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cueballcreatives.com/unlimited-graphic-design-plan\",\n      \"priceSpecification\": {\n        \"@type\": \"UnitPriceSpecification\",\n        \"price\": \"1199\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n        \"unitText\": \"MONTH\"\n      },\n      \"shippingDetails\": {\n        \"@type\": \"OfferShippingDetails\",\n        \"shippingRate\": {\n          \"@type\": \"MonetaryAmount\",\n          \"value\": \"0\",\n          \"currency\": \"USD\"\n        },\n        \"shippingDestination\": {\n          \"@type\": \"DefinedRegion\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\n        },\n        \"deliveryTime\": {\n          \"@type\": \"ShippingDeliveryTime\",\n          \"handlingTime\": {\n            \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n            \"minValue\": 0,\n            \"maxValue\": 0,\n            \"unitCode\": \"DAY\"\n          },\n          \"transitTime\": {\n            \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n            \"minValue\": 0,\n            \"maxValue\": 0,\n            \"unitCode\": \"DAY\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"hasMerchantReturnPolicy\": {\n        \"@type\": \"MerchantReturnPolicy\",\n        \"applicableCountry\": \"US\",\n        \"returnPolicyCategory\": \"https://schema.org/MerchantReturnNotPermitted\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"aggregateRating\": {\n    \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\n    \"ratingValue\": \"4.7\",\n    \"reviewCount\": \"84\",\n    \"bestRating\": \"5\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n\n<!-- ============================================================== -->\n<!-- 3. FAQPAGES SCHEMA (ALL 18 FAQS)                               -->\n<!-- ============================================================== -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"@id\": \"https://www.cueballcreatives.com/unlimited-graphic-design-plan#faq\",\n  \"url\": \"https://www.cueballcreatives.com/unlimited-graphic-design-plan\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is an unlimited graphic design subscription package?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Unlimited graphic design subscription packages let you submit ongoing design requests for a flat monthly fee instead of per-project billing. All our flat rate graphic design services operate on the same quality and workflow standard regardless of which plan you choose. Our flat-rate graphic design services are completely transparent. You pay what you see.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much does a graphic design subscription cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Our graphic design package pricing is structured around production capacity rather than service type. Cueball\u2019s graphic design subscription cost ranges from $449 to $1199 per month, depending on how many tasks you want moving in parallel. Every graphic design monthly subscription is billed on a month-to-month basis with no long-term commitment required. Compared to hiring in-house, the graphic design subscription cost is a fraction of the investment with no recruitment, onboarding overhead, or drifting quality issues.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you offer annual billing or discounts?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Our graphic design subscription plans are month-to-month by default, but if you'd like to save more, contact us to discuss annual, quarterly, or bi-annual billing options at reduced rates.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Are your graphic design packages suitable for small businesses?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes! Our Starter plan is an ideal graphic design package for small businesses or startups with low-volume design needs. The Growth plan is for marketing teams that require consistent creative support for their campaigns from a dedicated designer. The Scale plan is designed for agencies with multiple clients and high output from a dedicated creative team. You can choose the graphic design package that best fits your requirements.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is production capacity?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Production capacity refers to how many design tasks run in parallel at the same time in your monthly graphic design subscription. Your plan determines how many tasks your designer can execute simultaneously, keeping output predictable and at speed without compromising quality. For example: Starter: 1 active task, Growth: 3 active tasks, Scale: 5 active tasks.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What exactly qualifies as a \u201ctask\u201d?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A task is any separate design request you submit. For example: A logo, One Instagram post, A flyer, banner, or brochure, or A video edit or motion graphics piece. Each task moves through your designer\u2019s structured workflow. Multiple tasks can run in parallel, depending on your monthly graphic design subscription\u2019s production capacity.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I submit unlimited requests?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, you can queue unlimited requests. Active execution depends on your selected graphic design monthly subscription plan\u2019s capacity.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How fast is the turnaround time?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Most standard design tasks are completed within 12-48 business hours. More complex projects may take additional time depending on the task scope and your plan\u2019s production capacity.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What design types do you create, and what's not included?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Our unlimited graphic design subscription covers a wide range of marketing, brand, digital, print, web, and video design, including logos, brand identity, style guides, stationery, social media posts, ad creatives, landing pages, website UI/UX, illustrations, infographics, brochures, packaging, merchandise graphics, e-books, and motion graphics and video content. We do not support fine art illustrations, digital game assets, 3D/CAD projects, coding or development, interactive PDFs, unsupported file formats, trademarked content, copywriting, or inappropriate requests.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How does the unlimited graphic design free trial work?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Our unlimited graphic design subscription includes a 7-day risk-free trial. Submit real design requests and experience our workflow, design quality, and turnaround times before committing. Just book a free discovery call to get started. No credit card required. No contracts. You don\u2019t pay anything until you subscribe.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What happens after the trial period ends?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Your unlimited graphic design free trial gives you full access to the same workflow and quality as a paid plan. At the end of your unlimited graphic design free trial, if you\u2019re satisfied with our work, you can easily subscribe to one of our plans. If you decide it\u2019s not for you, feel free to cancel.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do I submit and manage design requests?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Once onboarded, you can submit design requests and briefs through your dedicated project management portal on Asana. Each brief is reviewed by your designer, who may ask clarifying questions before starting. You can track every active task, leave feedback directly on designs, and request revisions, all in one place. We also keep you updated via your preferred communication channel, whether email, Slack, or WhatsApp.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who works on my design requests?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Your primary designer, the one you selected during onboarding, handles all your requests and is your main creative contact. On the Scale plan, your primary designer is supported by a small dedicated creative team to ensure parallel tasks move efficiently at speed without compromising quality. You always have a single point of contact, and creative ownership stays with your dedicated designer throughout.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does Cueball use AI-generated design?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Our designers may use AI tools as creative aids for ideation, research, and workflow efficiency, but all final designs are created and refined by your dedicated human designer. We never deliver AI-generated output as a finished product. Your brand deserves genuine creative work, and that is always what you receive.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I use Cueball for multiple brands or clients?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, our graphic design subscription plans support multiple brands. The Scale plan is built exactly for agencies and teams managing multiple clients simultaneously. If you need unlimited graphic design packages across several brands, the Scale plan gives you the parallel capacity to keep every project moving at scale and speed without quality drift.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How can I cancel my subscription?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Canceling is straightforward. Simply send us an email before your next billing cycle. There are no lock-in contracts, no cancellation fees, and no lengthy processes. All our monthly graphic design packages are month-to-month, so you stay only as long as we're delivering value.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I pause my subscription?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, you can pause your subscription. Simply reach out to us before your next billing cycle and we'll put your plan on hold until you're ready to resume. Your dedicated designer and workflow remain in place, so you can pick up exactly where you left off.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What are Cueball's business hours?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We run on an overnight production cycle aligned to your time zone, and for most clients that's the quiet advantage of working with us. Brief us by the end of your day, and your designs are in production while you sleep, so finished work is waiting when you're back at your desk. We serve clients across North America, Europe, and beyond, and our turnaround is built to fit your working day rather than ours. We're flexible on availability, too. If your team spans multiple time zones, or there are specific hours when you need live communication and updates, just tell us during your discovery call and we'll set a rhythm that works for everyone. For urgent requests or time-sensitive feedback, flag the task in Asana or drop us a message on your preferred channel, and we'll respond as promptly as we can.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script><meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"B2nc6liuKdCYOt0-urvJZZ3X8Wo1SQ_YcecHNTnI-zE\" />\n<!-- Meta Pixel Code -->\n\n<noscript><img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"\nsrc=\"https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=950265393963406&ev=PageView&noscript=1\"\n/></noscript>\n<!-- End Meta Pixel Code -->\n<!-- Google Tag Manager -->\n\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\n<!-- Keep this css code to improve the font quality-->\n\n<!-- Hotjar Tracking Code for https://www.cueballcreatives.com -->\n\n<!-- LinkedIn Insight Tag Code for https://www.cueballcreatives.com -->\n\n<noscript>\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://px.ads.linkedin.com/collect/?pid=2262380&fmt=gif\" />\n</noscript>\n<!-- Microsoft Clarity Code for https://www.cueballcreatives.com -->\n\n\n<!-- Countdown -->\n\n<meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"nI54V7jcDyIrTeOiTq-VgJ7go0mDrQLAUY7el6tHUUg\" />\n\n<!-- ================================================================ -->\n<!-- UPDATED JSON-LD SCHEMA MARKUP \u2014 Cueball Creatives                -->\n<!-- Verified against live site: https://www.cueballcreatives.com/    -->\n<!-- Updated: September 2026                                          -->\n<!-- ================================================================ -->\n \n<!-- ============================================================== -->\n<!-- 1. ORGANIZATION (Clean & Google Compliant)                      -->\n<!-- ============================================================== -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"@id\": \"https://www.cueballcreatives.com/#organization\",\n  \"name\": \"Cueball Creatives\",\n  \"url\": \